# pull 형 CD — CI 통과 릴리스 자동 수거 (traffic-autoupdate.timer 가 5분 주기 호출)
[Unit]
Description=traffic auto-update (pull-based CD)

[Service]
Type=oneshot
WorkingDirectory=%h/traffic
ExecStart=/bin/bash %h/traffic/scripts/autoupdate.sh
StandardOutput=append:%h/traffic/data/autoupdate.log
StandardError=append:%h/traffic/data/autoupdate.log
